WEBVTT

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:00.997
Try asking someone for a ghost story.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:02.997
It's sure to start a conversation.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:05.230
Yeah, maybe they'll laugh at you,

00:11:05.263 --> 00:11:07.363
maybe they'll turn it back on you.

00:11:07.363 --> 00:11:08.997
Maybe they'll tell you a story

00:11:08.997 --> 00:11:12.197
that makes the hair on the back
of your neck stand on end.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.330
Maybe they'll tell you a story
that makes you cry.

00:11:15.863 --> 00:11:18.363
And maybe, if you're really lucky,

00:11:18.397 --> 00:11:20.763
they'll tell you a story
that makes you wonder

00:11:20.797 --> 00:11:22.430
what else you don't know,

00:11:22.463 --> 00:11:24.963
about a place, about a history,

00:11:24.997 --> 00:11:26.163
about a people,

00:11:26.197 --> 00:11:27.463
about each other

00:11:27.463 --> 00:11:28.730
and about yourself.

00:11:29.763 --> 00:11:31.197
Don't forget to ask,